  "description": "[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/5345000024) \n\nDelinquent Han Yu-chan. With no money and no powerful connections, he lived carefully, constantly keeping himself in check so he wouldn’t make enemies anywhere he went. But one day, despite all his efforts, Han Yu-chan is kidnapped and imprisoned by someone…\nInside the cold room where he is being held — a room without even a single window — there is a wolf with silver-gray fur tied up nearby.\nThinking he has been thrown in there as food for the wolf, Han Yu-chan causes a commotion. The beautiful wolf simply watches him quietly, as if observing and studying him.\nWhen Han Yu-chan feels the wolf’s gaze fixed on him and turns around, the wolf that had been there just moments ago has completely vanished. In its place stands a man wearing a collar, staring back at him.\nMore precisely, a man with wolf ears and a tail.\nAnd he has the face of Go Shin-woo — the actor who mysteriously disappeared one year ago",
